            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Collaboration with Actors and Writers</strong><br>\nHis frequent collaborations with actors like Leonardo DiCaprio and writers like Paul Schrader have produced a range of films that consistently push the boundaries of traditional storytelling and explore complex, often flawed characters.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Influence on Filmmaking and Culture</strong><br>\nScorsese's influence extends beyond his films, shaping the craft of filmmaking with his innovative techniques and deep respect for the medium's history. His films have become a vital part of American culture and cinema history.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Recognition and Awards</strong><br>\nScorsese has received numerous awards, including an Academy Award for Best Director for \"The Departed\" in 2006. His continued success in film ensures that his work remains relevant and influential, inspiring new generations of filmmakers.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
